tion":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3939960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Us!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/9151582df0604b8e25f4c486a727109e.avif?t=1764578685\" width=2048 height=682 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong></p></p><br><h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/9f68f7026e0ded573fa37c34398f44df.avif?t=1764578685\" width=1560 height=1335 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/85c8a2a27857df6a202fbdebcbc6e4eb.avif?t=1764578685\" width=1415 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cozy yet deadly farming game that marries relaxation and base defense in a bright post-apocalypse. Plant, nurture, and decorate your little refuge by day. Hold the line by night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/088be21a32f253ab825fd462cebb06f2.poster.avif?t=1764578685\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/088be21a32f253ab825fd462cebb06f2.webm?t=1764578685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/088be21a32f253ab825fd462cebb06f2.mp4?t=1764578685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Rory, a stubborn farmer trying to survive in this world. When The Fall happened, you went into cryosleep and waited for the right time to wake up. Now that you are awake, you are supplying food to the survivors. Let go of the stress and relax with this simple and satisfying gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/494fdb03eb44753d006cc0fb4b907279.avif?t=1764578685\" width=1560 height=91 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/b56205a94315b75b1031765039e54e78.poster.avif?t=1764578685\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/b56205a94315b75b1031765039e54e78.webm?t=1764578685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/b56205a94315b75b1031765039e54e78.mp4?t=1764578685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops, sell your harvest, and reinvest in seeds, tools, and upgrades to slowly turn a tiny homestead into a flourishing refuge. Start with a limited farm and expand it plot by plot, unlocking new crops, decorations, and mechanics along the way. Make it grow bigger and more beautiful until you have the best farm there is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/fc37f4562dffccbc8fa7a9c8a637a94f.avif?t=1764578685\" width=1545 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/50b1f8d6bbebac0c7dd24ebb74a4b441.poster.avif?t=1764578685\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/50b1f8d6bbebac0c7dd24ebb74a4b441.webm?t=1764578685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/50b1f8d6bbebac0c7dd24ebb74a4b441.mp4?t=1764578685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night brings waves of Unfed. They will breach your walls to get inside, so clever layout and strong defenses matter more than ever. Build barricades, turrets, traps, and use your super Death Mecha to defend your farm against a variety of zombies, each with different effects and unique ways of disrupting your farming experience. Once the night is over, repair your walls through mini-games and rise again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/6bd7aa128470b804228a11a6750a3569.avif?t=1764578685\" width=1161 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/8d608a0817eb8b2eaab16e9c5f700be2.poster.avif?t=1764578685\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/8d608a0817eb8b2eaab16e9c5f700be2.webm?t=1764578685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/8d608a0817eb8b2eaab16e9c5f700be2.mp4?t=1764578685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new farm upgrades and optimize your production. Less water consumption? More crops produced? Faster-growing crops? More firepower for your Mecha? You can have all that and make your experience smooth and unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having an optimized farm is cool, but having a beautiful, optimized farm is better! Decorate and customize your farm to feel at home, even in the middle of an apocalypse of the Unfed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now that you know what's waiting for you in Can't Stop Rory, let's build the best farm in history!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Confused Grandma Games","Zero Point One Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/d0e5ae47fbbb02db8ae309fa778a11bb81107163/header.jpg?t=1764578685","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS (64-bit) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS (64-bit) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.co